This project generates Mojo bindings for cvc5 (https://github.com/cvc5/cvc5).
Generated files (api/ and every file under src/cvc5_mojo/ except
src/cvc5_mojo/_c/ffi.mojo) contain names, enum values and documentation
derived from cvc5, which is copyright (C) 2009-2026 by its authors and
contributors and is distributed under the modified BSD (BSD-3-Clause) license.

Binary packages built from recipes/cvc5_mojo bundle the official cvc5
shared libraries, which include or link:
  - cvc5: BSD-3-Clause
  - MiniSat and CaDiCaL: MIT
  - GMP, MPFR and LibPoly: LGPL-3.0
See the cvc5 COPYING file and licenses/ directory shipped with each package.
